maya: I'll open: DOCS-128 (sample + guidance), SDK-289 (resume header handling + conservative defaults), METRICS-77 (streaming replay telemetry).

simon: Couple of follow-ups before closing: 1) document Dedicated/Private behavior (admins may disable resume tokens), 2) define retention semantics for resume tokens (how long server keeps them), 3) add an opt-in server flag to emit `X-Replay-Allowed` for legacy compat.

niko: Also recommend a warning in the SDK logs when automatic retry is disabled due to streaming — helps customers debug why they see 429s instead of automatic reconnection.

kevin: I'll prototype the SDK change today and link an RFC. maya: pls add sample and docs. niko: can you write the retry policy blurb we can paste into the SDK README?

maya: On it. Will include code sample, logs to look for, and rollout notes. Assigning: @kevin SDK proto, @maya docs+sample, @niko retry policy. Reopen if CI reproduces. :thumbsup:
